# The same public input path as a player: first release E before three seconds to prove
# cancellation, then hold it continuously to arm the spectacle and again to restore the zoo.
2 hold E
100 shot ../build-probe/shots/apocalypse-hold.png
108 release E
118 shot ../build-probe/shots/apocalypse-cancelled.png
130 hold E
318 release E
324 shot ../build-probe/shots/apocalypse-active.png
900 shot ../build-probe/shots/apocalypse-escape.png
920 hold E
1108 release E
1114 shot ../build-probe/shots/apocalypse-restored.png
